<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<subsection xml:id="sec-14-writing-assignments-summer">
  <title>Writing Assignments</title>

  <p>
    Writing in this course supports mathematical reasoning, communication, and reflection.
    In summer sessions, writing activities are streamlined but still important for engagement
    and progress monitoring.
  </p>

  <paragraphs>
    <title>Check-Ins and Discussions</title>
    <p>
      Summer writing tasks may include short check-ins and discussion participation. Follow
      deadlines carefully because summer due dates arrive quickly.
    </p>
  </paragraphs>

  <paragraphs>
    <title>AI Policy for Writing</title>
    <p>
      Unless assignment instructions explicitly permit otherwise, submit your own original thinking.
      You may use generative AI for editing clarity and organization only when course policy allows
      and with proper citation.
    </p>
  </paragraphs>
</subsection>
